          "previewAudio": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/the-amazing-adventures-of-chilly-billy.mp3",
          "description": "Bestselling author Peter Mayle and acclaimed children’s book illustrator Arthur Robins combine their talents in this delightful children’s storybook. Once you’ve met Chilly Billy and heard of his adventures inside the refrigerator, you’ll never open the fridge door in quite the same way again! Chilly Billy is a fun and lovable character you won’t forget. Reissued exclusively through Escargot Books. Illustrated in black and white.",
